    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "The first step is to receive and categorize the invoice."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If the instruction is to \"Forward Invoice to Admin Officer\", then the next step is to sort the invoice."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "if the instruction is to \"Reject invoice\", then the process ends there."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "if the instruction is to \"Return invoice to client for completion\", then the invoice is received and categorized again."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "if the instruction is to \"Process Invoice for SAP Entry\", then the invoice is forwarded for validation."
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "Once the invoice is forwarded for validation, it is then validated, and the process ends."
